 r←Test_AskString_001(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "AskForString" method with defaults parameters only. Input via "KeyPress".
⍝ See also number 8
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Please enter your name:' '(Surname, first name)'

 n←myGuiParms parms(#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForString ∆Ask)''
 0.2 ∆Process n.∆Form
 n.Input ∆KeyPress'Kai'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.Input 9995
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →FailsIf'Kai'≢n.∆result  ⍝ Just execute →⎕lc and it will work  ⍝TODO⍝ discuss with Dyalog why that failes!

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
